<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01 · 进入边界与功能性包容：收纳、填满、提交与禁锢 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Functional Containment & Entry — EPE Ch.2 §4 & Ch.4 §2.3</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>186 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.2 §4 & Ch.4 §2.3 Figure 4.2)：</b>IN 的核心是<b>「几何包围与功能性包容（Functional Inclusion：容器限制主体使其不掉落或逃脱）」</b>。因此，进入房间/车辆（<i>get/walk/check in</i>）、把空白表格填满并交回收集箱（<i>fill/hand/turn in</i>）、以及像倒扣的碗困住烟雾一样把人围困限制住（<i>lock/hem/box/fence in</i>）均用 IN。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>1/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>provide with shelter</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>house, domiciliate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>take</b> it <b>in</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>give <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [submit] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>yield to another's wish or opinion</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>submit, bow</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The government bowed to the military pressure.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>2/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>fool or hoax</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>gull, dupe</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The immigrant was duped because he trusted everyone.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>You can't fool me!</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>3/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [absorb] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>take up mentally</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>absorb, assimilate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He absorbed the knowledge or beliefs of his tribe.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>4/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>fold up</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>furl</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Take</b> <b>in</b> the sails.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>5/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [receive] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>express willingness to have in one's home or environs</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>receive, invite</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The community warmly received the refugees.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>6/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>see or watch</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>watch, view</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>View a show on television.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>This program will be seen all over the world.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>View an exhibition.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>7/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [collect] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>call for and obtain payment of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>collect</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>We collected over a million dollars in outstanding debts.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He collected the rent.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>8/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>visit for entertainment</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>visit, see</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Take</b> <b>in</b> the sights.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>9/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>make (clothes) smaller</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>vary</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Please <b>take</b> <b>in</b> this skirt--I've lost weight.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 13 个核心义项'>10/13</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [adopt] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>take into one's family</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>adopt</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They adopted two children from Nicaragua.</div></div></div></td></tr>
