<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>coop <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [confine] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>confine in or as if in a coop</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>confine</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>She <b>coops</b> herself up <b>in</b> the library all day.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>muster <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [enlist] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>engage somebody to enter the army</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>enlist, draft</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>muster</b> it <b>in</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>sow <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [inseminate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>place seeds in or on (the ground)</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>inseminate, sow</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Sow the ground with sunflower seeds.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>abound <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：拉丁/法语学术词根 [abound] + 作为正式词 [exist] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>exist in large quantity</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>exist</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>abound</b> it <b>in</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>hem <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [besiege] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>surround so as to force to give up</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>besiege, beleaguer</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The Turks besieged Vienna.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>hem <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [surround] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>surround in a restrictive manner</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>surround, environ</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The building was <b>hemmed</b> <b>in</b> by flowers.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Formal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>partake <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Formal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：拉丁/法语学术词根 [partake]' style='cursor:help;'>🏛️ 正式/书面 (Formal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>have, give, or receive a share of</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>partake, share</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We shared the cake.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>plump <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>arrive suddenly and unannounced</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>arrive</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He <b>plumped</b> <b>in</b> on a Sunday morning.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02 · 摄入大脑或欺骗圈套：吸收、理解、蒙蔽与留宿 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Absorption, Comprehension & Deception — EPE Ch.4</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>12 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.4)：</b>人体和大脑是最典型的容器——将水分或知识摄入体内/脑内即为吸收与彻底领会（<i>take/soak/sink in</i>）；把流浪者接纳进屋檐下即为收留（<i>take in</i>）；而把轻信的受害者诱骗进圈套或牢笼里即为欺骗蒙蔽（<i>take/suck/lure/reel in</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>drink <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be fascinated or spell-bound by; pay close attention to</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>drink, steep</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The mother <b>drinks</b> <b>in</b> every word of her son on the stage.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>draw <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>1/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [attract] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>direct toward itself or oneself by means of some psychological power or physical attributes</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>attract, pull</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Her good looks attract the stares of many men.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The ad pulled in many potential customers.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>This pianist pulls huge crowds.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>draw <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>3/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [aspirate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>draw in as if by suction</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>aspirate, hollow</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Suck in your cheeks and stomach.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>draw <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>4/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>of trains; move into (a station)</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>arrive</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The bullet train drew into Tokyo Station.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>draw <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>5/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [advance] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>advance or converge on</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>advance, progress</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The police were closing in on him.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>draw <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>6/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>shape one's body into a curl</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>curl, attract</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She curled farther down under the covers.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>She fell and drew in.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>suck <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [consume] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>take up as if with a sponge</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>consume, ingest</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>suck</b> it <b>in</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>suck <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [aspirate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>draw in as if by suction</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>aspirate, hollow</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Suck</b> <b>in</b> your cheeks and stomach.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>suck <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>attract by using an inexorable force, inducement, etc.</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>suck, absorb</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The current boom in the economy <b>sucked</b> many workers <b>in</b> from abroad.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>sink <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [percolate] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>pass through</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>percolate, permeate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Water permeates sand easily.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>rope <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [persuade] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>draw in as if with a rope; lure</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>persuade</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The agent had <b>roped</b> <b>in</b> several customers.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>rope <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [enclose] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>divide by means of a rope</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>enclose, inclose</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The police roped off the area where the crime occurred.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03 · 进入社交活动圈：参与、插嘴、干预、凑份与替补 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Entering Activity Space — EPE Ch.4 §4</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>26 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.1 §8.10 & Ch.4 §4)：</b>EPE 指出英语将<b>「活动、谈话、团体与局势视为三维空间容器（Activities & States are Spaces）」</b>。因此，加入活动或向资金池投钱用 IN（<i>join/pitch/chip in</i>）；未经允许强行挤进别人的谈话或事务空间即为插嘴或干预（<i>cut/butt/chime/step/meddle in</i>）；顶替空缺位置即为替补（<i>fill/stand in for</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>call <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>1/7</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>summon to a particular activity or employment</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>summon</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Experts were <b>called</b> <b>in</b>.</div></div></div></td></tr>
