<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04 · 向中心内聚坍塌：屈服让步、内塌、盈利与开启生效 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Inward Collapse & Activation — EPE Ch.2 §5</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>22 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.2 §5)：</b>当容器壁承受不住外部高压时，会<b>向中心内侧崩塌（Inward Collapse）</b>——屋顶向内塌陷叫 <i>cave/fall in</i>，人在争执中顶不住压力让步屈服也叫 <i>cave/give in</i>；把筹码或支票塞进收银台换回真金白银叫兑现获利（<i>cash/rake in</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
